%S A402003 1,1,2,5,9,22,37,80,149,321,638,1336,2701,5637,11592,24223,50183,
%T A402003 104711,217554,453635,944098,1968305,4099795
%N A402003 Number of free n-celled polyominoes that do not contain a copy of the quasi-polyomino {(0,0),(2,2)} (up to translations, rotations, and reflections), i.e., polyominoes that do not contain any two cells at distance sqrt(8).
%C A402003 Extending the forbidden quasi-polyomino {(0,0),(2,2)} to {(0,0),(1,0),(2,2)} gives the same sequence, because any polyomino containing a copy of the former also contains a copy of the latter.
%Y A402003 Rows n=18 and n=20 of A401999.
%Y A402003 Cf. A000105, A401400, A401401, A401402, A401403, A402001, A402002.
